{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine Sisyphus Happy</strong> is a game where\u00a0Sisyphus didn't give up \u2013 he decided to livestream his eternal struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe struggle itself toward the heights is enough to fill a human\u2019s heart. One must imagine Sisyphus happy.\u201d</i> \u2013 Albert Camus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.webm?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.mp4?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine Sisyphus Happy</strong> is a wild mixture of Streamer Simulator, Clicker and Mini-Games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the boulder and entertain the chat to get more views and donations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert views into subscribers, to get even more donations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen (or ignore) chat's mood and demand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new jobs and sceneries - from pushing a cart in the supermarket to running a hamster wheel in the office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new boulders, decorations, gear, shaders and soundtracks - each with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills, improve stamina and agility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to chain tricks to make crazy stunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a perfect scene for your perfect stunt to get your subs' hard-earned donations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/4b8d02f0c1096cc10e1b569d3aada32d.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" width=280 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/4b8d02f0c1096cc10e1b569d3aada32d.webm?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/4b8d02f0c1096cc10e1b569d3aada32d.mp4?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/db31863a454e9570f182c8002505af9d.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" width=280 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/db31863a454e9570f182c8002505af9d.webm?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/db31863a454e9570f182c8002505af9d.mp4?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/73559a9fa5f0cea4fe328ce14db686b1.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" width=400 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/73559a9fa5f0cea4fe328ce14db686b1.webm?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/73559a9fa5f0cea4fe328ce14db686b1.mp4?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the boulder. Do tricks. Go live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/5138e61cd77bb5c4986b63c0ee57a84f.apng?t=1769020222\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/5138e61cd77bb5c4986b63c0ee57a84f.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" class=\"bb_img\" width=240 height=240 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/6364d9a402bd402cb8af705e21d34ffc.apng?t=1769020222\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/6364d9a402bd402cb8af705e21d34ffc.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" class=\"bb_img\" width=240 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphus, king of Corinth, has tricked the Gods and Death. To punish him, the Gods condemned him to push a boulder uphill forever, only for it to roll back each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But Sisyphus didn't give up. He decided to livestream it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a463eafc6c651273f5ec1215dd54452a.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a463eafc6c651273f5ec1215dd54452a.webm?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a463eafc6c651273f5ec1215dd54452a.mp4?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a meta-narrative game about spectacle and finding meaning in repetition. Roll your boulder, pull off stunts, and try to make the eternal grind worth living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressing from Greek myth to the modern day, the story asks two simple questions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aren\u2019t you a Sisyphus too?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you Imagine Sisyphus Happy?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/ae21a049354ef1e954deb57474680269.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/ae21a049354ef1e954deb57474680269.webm?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/ae21a049354ef1e954deb57474680269.mp4?t=1769020222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people ask - can you win this game? You decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current demo is but a small draft. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full release in 2026 will have:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More tricks and trick chains - infinite combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless collectathon, hundreds of unclocks - scenes and decorations, Boulders, Sisyphus skins and variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steamer economy simulation - views, subs, donations, chat requests, and dozens of stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short streaming session + endless meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of Sisyphean Struggles - depicting your daily life, with a variety of QTEs - find your own boulder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop - make your own boulders &amp; struggles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration for streamers - make you chat Sisyphus!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meme-generator - pre-set tricks and chat messages, make new Sisyphus stories</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959020?t=1769020222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/edfc697dbf2f7fcf881ae5d7d66c4f30e94c3cee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769020222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/755206e31a4565f94e9c38453b41ac36d965bbca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769020222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/755206e31a4565f94e9c38453b41ac36d965bbca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769020222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imagine Sisyphus Happy</strong> is a game where\u00a0Sisyphus didn't give up \u2013 he decided to livestream his eternal struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe struggle itself toward the heights is enough to fill a human\u2019s heart. One must imagine Sisyphus happy.\u201d</i> \u2013 Albert Camus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.poster.avif?t=1769020222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://sha